message: "If you use this tool, please cite it as below."
title: "ICU-DEX: An Interactive Reference Tool for Critical Care Education"
abstract: >-
  ICU-DEX is a browser-based educational reference that organizes core critical
  care concepts, drug and device parameters, and bedside decision frameworks into
  a searchable interface for medical students, international medical graduates,
  and early trainees. Intended for education only; not validated as a clinical
  decision support system.
type: software
